    description: Some("Two musical memory games. In Follow the Leader, an arrow points at one of four coloured triangles as each note of a tune plays; repeat the sequence with the joystick as it grows longer, up to forty notes. In Clef Climber, the computer plays a note and you raise or lower your own until it matches, with options to hide the notes on the staff."),
